==============================================================================
N-015  sweep_outcomes: SELL_SIDE counts an UP move as genuine
==============================================================================
  SELL_SIDE sweep at bar 0, next 5 closes all 99.0 (price FELL back under the level = the contract's 'genuine')
    sweep_outcomes -> (0.0, 1)
  same sweep, next 5 closes all 101.0 (price ROSE through the level = NOT a reversal)
    sweep_outcomes -> (1.0, 1)
  source: `move = max(f.close - base ...)` for SELL_SIDE — a HIGHER close
         is scored as the successful outcome.
  BUY_SIDE mirror, closes falling to 99.0 -> (1.0, 1)  (mirrored too)
  only t+1 of horizon=5 exists -> n counted: 1 (1, not 0 — partial horizon still scored)

